# RT-HWGI-NIGHT-LEAK: Bistro night under hardware traced GI against the path tracer (shield) and against the
# leaf's own albedo (cypress; the path tracer has no foliage transmission, so it is no reference there).
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Night.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: TAA"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид a_default the same view without hardware tracing, the comparison base
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид b_hwrefl hardware reflections alone: the shield is not blue
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 90
Тогда-вид hwgi_shield the shield is teal as in the path tracer, not blue
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид hwgi_cypress the cypress reflects and transmits no more energy than its albedo allows: not brighter than in a_default by the second albedo
Когда run View "View mode: Base Color"
Когда frames 8
Тогда-вид e_basecolor the cypress base colour is its reflected part, half its albedo map at the default tint
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent Level"
Тогда z the levels are restored
